    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alaá deelór niinawe slaqwaruusér xoorór Moabu, nee múk Amoni dinkwa nee múk niiná oo Meuni",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20:1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Meuni:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Baraá gooi bahh'ale ar Ebraniaro gár taa gooín a Amoni.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " yaamaá Yuda ngina i haratlayé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ya/abuuse iri hardáh dír waawutmo Yehoshafati kuri báy, «Slaqwaruusér yaariir naa haratleér ar amór Edomu daahh, gayuú tlawtá Diwi. Inooín yaamaá Hasason-tamari nga qaroó hayoohiyé'.» (Gaarí an umuú hatlá' oo yaamaá ta bay Engedi). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoshafati iri ló' wa da'ayuút, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ guna ló'wa firín nguwa gan'aasi. Afo gari ilahariís dír muu sleémeero oo yaamaá Yuda as tawa gwaawin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muu sleémeero oo yaamaá Yuda iri burumbuuriít baraá gixsár Yerusalemu as alee/isaay nguwa firina' dír AAKOÓ MUNGÚ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoshafati iri sihhiít geeraá mukduú Yerusalemu nee oo Yuda, kudaá burumburiit dír afeenidá' /aben ar doó Mungú. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iri firín ar afór ur iwa kaahi, «Aá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguú baabi'iirén, kuúng a Munguú gawaá doori, xoordu sleémeero in sawaawuti'iín, kuúng a /uuruú koón nee aleesleemu, slamí heé kuúng u tlaampa'aás i kaahh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aá Munguúrén, kuúng yaamuloouusér yaamuuká' aga guskáhe geeraá mukók oo Israeli wa ale, yaamu kiri xwaylár Abrahamu mulqumoowók i hanís as tawa kooín ay alhhe'eesay wasle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín naa baraaká wa hootiyé', nee dír hotaawók ngiri tleehhiyé' as umuuwók kuwa ilaiwawaa/i, iwa kaahiya', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "barnaxes amotlakwe taa sleér laqaá slaqwara, laqaá sakwasleema, laqaá tiqtír pu/i, laqaá giyeé, atén an dír geeraá do'owí sihhitaán nee dír geeraawók, asma umuuwók i baraá do'owí, nee qoomár slahh'amuurene nin amoorók i /aa/aán, kuúng atén ti iiárií qas nee ti ba/amis.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Hamí ga/aaweek múk Amoni, nee oo Moabu nee múk tloomár Seirír daáhh, kudá' kuúng múk Israeli kuwa ilá/ as mukwí mukuwa i haratláy, qoomár inooín niwa baraá yaamaá Misrír wa ti'iitiyé', nee nguna afií wa oohiyé' as mikiwa hhaamiís. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamí gár atén tira bu'uyé' a, atén tiwa guusiya' baraá yaamuudá' kuúng naa aténí hanisi tawa aalirén. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aá Munguúrén, sakwasleema a tók, asma atén /uuru u koomanaaká oo nee xooroorí ur naa amoorén i haratleer tawa slaqwaan. Atén adór ta laqaan a xuanaaká, aqo har kuúng un harahhifaán.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomaadae hhawaate sleémeero awa Yuda dinkwa nee tlaaway'ine nee na/ii'ine tana sihhiít dír geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy Qeeruú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ iri hardáh dír heeko wák oo tlahhoó Laáwi oo didií dirií'. Umuuwós a Yahasieli garmoó Sekaria, garmoó Benaya, garmoó Yeieli, garmoó Matania oo guruú doó Asafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yahasieli iri oó', «Iia qaasaak, kuungaá múk Yuda nee yaamuloouusér Yerusalemu dinkwa nee waawutmo Yehoshafati! AAKOÓ MUNGÚ i kaahi, ‹Ma da'ayuumitaara', laqaá ma amoqwaqwadimara' as slaqwaruuseerí yaariir. Slaqwararí a toohungeeká, slaqwaraarí ar Mungú. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Matlo kuungá' i haraatlawaak, qoomár bir gáwtí tsa/a/aná' baraá xatstá Sisír wa alé. Kuungá' i aleesleerá' dír alhhe'eesoó xatsa, dír nira hardihi'iiká dír xaanxoó Yerueli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' a slaqwa'aaká nee inooín, kuungá' ti amohhe'ese' daqaní ka daandá', kuungá' aqo aandá' adór anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ nir kitangwhúng wa slaáqw. Kuungá' múk Yuda nee oo Yerusalemu, ma da'ayuumitaara', laqaá ma amoqwaqwadimara'. Tlawsé', slaqwara awaak matlo, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ a dinkwa nee kuungá'.› »",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo Yehoshafati nee muu sleémeero oo Yuda dinkwa nee yaamuloouusér Yerusalemu AAKOÓ MUNGÚ kway i xupuú' kway sluufmiís. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk tlahhoó Laáwi nee oo guruú doó Kohati nee oo Kora tari sihhiít AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguú múk Israeli, nguri xirfayemisiyé' ar afór ló'wa ur.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Looa niwa tleér matlaatlér boo/e tana tseewa tláy amór xaanxoó Tekoa. Qoomár tawa tlatlay, waawutmo Yehoshafati ina geeraaín i sihhiít giri báy, «Aá múk Yuda nee yaamuloouusér Yerusalemu, án iiárií qaasaré'! AAKOÓ MUNGÚ haratlintiaak, kuungá' daqaní a gawduurá', nee aaruuseerós haratlintiaak, daqaní kuungá' a baaliindá'.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alaá mukós gurbu'uto nguwa hhe'eés, waawutmo Yehoshafati daauuse gari tsawaár, tlabaaín ngiri dahaasiyé', niri hi'iitiyé' geeraá slaqwaruusér wa alé tawa daai, ta kaahi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár daa'aangw kuwa iimu/ún, nee xirfayeemisuuwo, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ slaqwaruuseedár Amoni nee ar Moabu, nee ar tloomár Seirír daahh, tidá' naa haratleer amór múk Yuda, gari amoqwaareés, slaqwara ngiri harslaaqatiyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Amoni nee oo Moabu nay haratlayé' amór múk tlom'aá Seiri, kari ló'wa hhaamiís. Alaá múk tloomár Seiri kuwa hhaamiís, tiri kilooín saki/iyé', tiri faakiyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár slaqwaruusér Yuda tawa hardáh dír /aampadár xuuma, tidár baraá xaanxaay, tawa qaytsiít amór wakuuser'ín, gár taa ár a tu'u yaamu ngaa dalaa/iyé', heé aa meet tumu wák i kaahh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
