        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo Yehoshafati waawuti'iimár Yuda ngiwa iimu/ún kureeriiwós a mibeeri tám nee kooán. Inós ina baraá Yerusalemúr wa waawuti'ii'ín kureeri mibeeri tsár nee kooán. Umuú aayoorós a Asuba dasír Shilhi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós aa warqayká, ina hoót ar adoodá' baabuúwós Asa ira hoót, hotaá ganaa'á' gina ar hoót dír geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGUHE. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tam adoorihe wa/angwduú gawaá gongoama' kudá' munguaá hatlá' kiwa sluufmaamisi gwaa fee/iiká, nee muu muner'ín ngaa amór Munguú baabi'ii'ín xu'usi'iiká.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
